constraints:
1 ≤ |S| ≤ 10^{6}
1 ≤ |T| ≤ 10^{6}
All characters are either capital or numeric.

expected time complexity: O(|T|)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def checkCompressed(self, S, T):
		c = 0
		j = 0
		k = 0
		for i in range(len(T)):
			if ord('0') <= ord(T[i]) <= ord('9'):
				c = c * 10 + int(T[i])
			else:
				j = j + c
				c = 0
				if j >= len(S):
					return 0
				if S[j] != T[i]:
					return 0
				j += 1
		j = j + c
		if j != len(S):
			return 0
		return 1
